      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_4433b979d419727f08ef835155924937a4980ac31ade9cca06bd0139a1447c32"
      ],
      "text": "Assistant detection is done by taking a single ps snapshot, finding children of each tmux pane shell, and matching known assistant binary names such as claude, copilot, opencode, codex, pi, omp, and grok."
    },
