  "summary": "A tmux-resurrect plugin that saves and restores AI coding assistant sessions (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, OpenCode, Codex, Pi, Oh My Pi, Grok) by detecting assistant processes, extracting session IDs via hooks/plugins/process args, and replaying resume commands after tmux restarts. Evidence is README-only documentation of the product's design, configuration, and testing workflow. Evidence coverage: 134 of 163 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
